                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "一、单选题(共5题，每题4分，共20分)"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                78,
                273,
                457,
                292
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1. 两平行平面  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "Ax + By + Cz = D_{1}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 与  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "Ax + By + Cz = D_{2}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 之间的距离为（）.\n(A)   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\left||D_{2}\\right| - \\left|D_{1}\\right|\\left|\\right|"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "  (B)   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\left|D_{2} - D_{1}\\right|"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "  (C)   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\frac{\\left|\\left|D_{2}\\right| - \\left|D_{1}\\right|\\right|}{\\sqrt{A^{2} + B^{2} + C^{2}}}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "  (D)   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\frac{\\left|D_{2} - D_{1}\\right|}{\\sqrt{A^{2} + B^{2} + C^{2}}}"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                78,
                300,
                808,
                357
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2. 考虑二元函数的下面 4 条性质：\n①  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "f(x,y)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 在点  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "(x_{0},y_{0})"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 处连续；②  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "f(x,y)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 在点  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "(x_{0},y_{0})"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 处的两个偏导数连续；\n③  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "f(x,y)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 在点  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "(x_{0},y_{0})"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 处可微；④  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "f(x,y)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 在点  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "(x_{0},y_{0})"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 处的两个偏导数存在."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                78,
                365,
                675,
                434
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "若用 “  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "A \\Rightarrow B"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ” 表示可由性质A推出B，则有（）.\n(A) ②⇒③⇒① (B) ③⇒②⇒① (C) ③⇒④⇒① (D) ③⇒①⇒④"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                114,
                439,
                781,
                481
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "3. 设  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "f(x,y)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 是连续函数，交换二次积分  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\int_{0}^{1}\\mathrm{d}y\\int_{y}^{\\sqrt{y}}x\\mathrm{d}x"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 的积分次序后的结果为（）.\n(A)  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\int_{0}^{1}\\mathrm{d}x\\int_{y}^{\\sqrt{y}}x\\mathrm{d}y"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "  (B)  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\int_{0}^{1}\\mathrm{d}y\\int_{x}^{\\sqrt{x}}y\\mathrm{d}x"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "  (C)  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\int_{0}^{1}\\mathrm{d}x\\int_{x^{2}}^{x}x\\mathrm{d}y"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "  (D)  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\int_{0}^{1}\\mathrm{d}x\\int_{x}^{x^{2}}x\\mathrm{d}y"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                77,
                489,
                808,
                574
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "(A) 利用积分曲线的参数方程将对弧长的曲线积分转换为定积分计算时, 积分下限一定小于上限. (B) 利用积分曲线的参数方程将对坐标的曲线积分转换为定积分计算时, 积分下限一定小于上限."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                119,
                613,
                878,
                655
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "（C）设曲面  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\Sigma: z = 0, (x, y) \\in D"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " （闭区域），则  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\iint_{\\Sigma} f(x, y, z) dx dy = \\iint_{D} f(x, y, 0) dx dy."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                122,
                659,
                786,
                694
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "（D）设曲面  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\Sigma: z = 0, (x, y) \\in D"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " （闭区域），则  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\iint_{\\Sigma} f(x, y, z) dx dy = -\\iint_{D} f(x, y, 0) dx dy."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                122,
                697,
                798,
                731
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "5. 设  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "a_{n} \\leq c_{n} \\leq b_{n}(n=1,2,\\cdots)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "，且级数  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} a_{n}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 与  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} b_{n}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 均收敛，则级数  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} c_{n}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " （）."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                78,
                740,
                712,
                787
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "（C）未必收敛，但  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}c_n=0"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "  （D）  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}c_n"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 存在但未必等于0"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                80,
                824,
                880,
                869
            ]
        },
